111
00:05:24,820 --> 00:05:25,040
Wish.

112
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:25,960
Outcome.

113
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:26,700
Obstacle.

114
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:27,140
Plan.

115
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:31,480
Across 21 studies and nearly 16 ,000 people, it

116
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:35,100
improved goal attainment with a small but reliable effect,

117
00:05:35,580 --> 00:05:37,980
and a larger one when done with another person.

118
00:05:38,780 --> 00:05:42,640
Ottingen's participants did not have MD, so applying this

119
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:45,540
to MD is an inference, but a close one.

120
00:05:46,040 --> 00:05:48,380
We will build a full whoop in chapter 9.

121
00:05:48,980 --> 00:05:51,180
Your pattern includes excitement as a trigger.

122
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:54,320
No study has tested this, so treat it as

123
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,500
