128
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,680
Energy for the real next step drops, and that

129
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:15,020
last link is the only one with experimental support.

130
00:06:15,500 --> 00:06:18,720
In favor of the idea, strong emotion of either

131
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:22,100
kind pulls thought inward, and people with MD score

132
00:06:22,100 --> 00:06:23,900
